TI  - Efficacy of a biofungicide based on Trichoderma afroharzianum CP 24–6 against cacao frosty pod rot under different doses and application timings
JF  - Frontiers in Plant Science
PB  - Frontiers Media
DO  - 10.3389/fpls.2026.1694820
